ebm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957670/extras/6c851198416ea53e29a82bb94494703b.mp4?t=1738752691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There are places to hide in each area to avoid the pursuit of ghosts and gain temporary breathing space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• props</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957670/extras/5a61296a681ff61ba98bb6a5e4758bfa.poster.avif?t=1738752691\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957670/extras/5a61296a681ff61ba98bb6a5e4758bfa.webm?t=1738752691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957670/extras/5a61296a681ff61ba98bb6a5e4758bfa.mp4?t=1738752691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Players can collect different types of props and materials along the way, and use them in a timely manner to increase their chances of survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Solve puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957670/extras/05c49548dcd57e584db311199d79d014.poster.avif?t=1738752691\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957670/extras/05c49548dcd57e584db311199d79d014.webm?t=1738752691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2957670/extras/05c49548dcd57e584db311199d79d014.mp4?t=1738752691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>There are various puzzles and mechanisms along the way, as well as the truth of all stories, waiting for 